(5678512, 825105, 70270, '<td valign="top">Love the lens baby, and the photo.  Could it be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>?  That''s a nice compliment if its not.  As much as I like the photo, however, I don''t see a real strong connection to the challenge, so it maxes out at a 6 from me.</td>', 'Love the lens baby, and the photo.  Could it be  Melethia?  That''s a nice compliment if its not.  As much as I like the photo, however, I don''t see a real strong connection to the challenge, so it maxes out at a 6 from me.', '2009-10-07 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678521, 825918, 70270, '<td valign="top">I think the overprocessing works here, with the dreamy high sat colors.  In fact, I think the processing is what makes this meet the challenge, because it gives it an ethereal feel that turns a pretty scene into a treasure, and makes it just odd enough that it would be hidden behind a veil of reality from most of us.  7</td>', 'I think the overprocessing works here, with the dreamy high sat colors.  In fact, I think the processing is what makes this meet the challenge, because it gives it an ethereal feel that turns a pretty scene into a treasure, and makes it just odd enough that it would be hidden behind a veil of reality from most of us.  7', '2009-10-07 14:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678559, 826223, 70270, '<td valign="top">too funny.  not a big fan of the processing, and don''t like the cropped claws at the top, but you made me look.  6</td>', 'too funny.  not a big fan of the processing, and don''t like the cropped claws at the top, but you made me look.  6', '2009-10-07 14:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
