(5678694, 825560, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, tightly composed, and perfect exposure for the silky fall and to preserve detail below the surface.  Like the processing and the treatment.  Gave you a 6.  In another challenge it would have been a 7 or higher.  Here, however, its just not a tight enough tie to the topic to score there.  I understand the concept of a pretty place being a hidden treasure, but just don''t think that''s strong enough to put shots like this in the top ranks.  (fwiw I looked really hard at the spot of gold under the surface to see if maybe that was your treasure, but all I got was a blur that looks like maybe a fallen leaf).</td>', 'Nice scene, tightly composed, and perfect exposure for the silky fall and to preserve detail below the surface.  Like the processing and the treatment.  Gave you a 6.  In another challenge it would have been a 7 or higher.  Here, however, its just not a tight enough tie to the topic to score there.  I understand the concept of a pretty place being a hidden treasure, but just don''t think that''s strong enough to put shots like this in the top ranks.  (fwiw I looked really hard at the spot of gold under the surface to see if maybe that was your treasure, but all I got was a blur that looks like maybe a fallen leaf).', '2009-10-07 15:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
