(5679899, 825610, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Treasures are in the eye of the beerholder :) Nice focus, great timing just before takoff, a tad too much flash imo.</td>', 'DMC. Treasures are in the eye of the beerholder :) Nice focus, great timing just before takoff, a tad too much flash imo.', '2009-10-08 03:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679938, 826046, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Stamen (?) inside as the flower is opening. I would have scored higher if the stamen had had more DOF, hard to do to keep the petals out of focus I know.</td>', 'DMC. Stamen (?) inside as the flower is opening. I would have scored higher if the stamen had had more DOF, hard to do to keep the petals out of focus I know.', '2009-10-08 03:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679946, 826206, 108580, '<td valign="top">Yes, common argument that runs through the Forum. Who''s treasure is it anyway? <br/>On the merits of the photo, good focus, action captured, nice settled tones on main subject, sky too light for me (damn isn''t nature a b!@#$ for not giving you aqua blue?) but shutterspeed a tad too slow as right gloved hand blurred. I beleive in stopping the action dead in it''s tracks or not at all.</td>', 'Yes, common argument that runs through the Forum. Who''s treasure is it anyway? On the merits of the photo, good focus, action captured, nice settled tones on main subject, sky too light for me (damn isn''t nature a b!@#$ for not giving you aqua blue?) but shutterspeed a tad too slow as right gloved hand blurred. I beleive in stopping the action dead in it''s tracks or not at all.', '2009-10-08 03:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679948, 826204, 108580, '<td valign="top">Yes, nature is a treasure. DMC. Unless my eyes are shot, the butterfly is totally OOF, so I''ve scored lowish. Sorry!</td>', 'Yes, nature is a treasure. DMC. Unless my eyes are shot, the butterfly is totally OOF, so I''ve scored lowish. Sorry!', '2009-10-08 03:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679950, 826119, 108580, '<td valign="top">Too much road in the right, a tighter crop would have improved this.</td>', 'Too much road in the right, a tighter crop would have improved this.', '2009-10-08 03:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679951, 825617, 108580, '<td valign="top">OK I get the concept but theres just not enough in it for me to see treasure, maybe the expectation of treasure in or around the derelict house! Sorry!</td>', 'OK I get the concept but theres just not enough in it for me to see treasure, maybe the expectation of treasure in or around the derelict house! Sorry!', '2009-10-08 03:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679953, 826111, 108580, '<td valign="top">I hesitate to comment. This shot is really personal to you. Perhaps the IF buds leading to the OOF flowers (treasure)?</td>', 'I hesitate to comment. This shot is really personal to you. Perhaps the IF buds leading to the OOF flowers (treasure)?', '2009-10-08 03:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679954, 826175, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Moth sucking nectar is treasure to the moth.</td>', 'DMC. Moth sucking nectar is treasure to the moth.', '2009-10-08 03:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679955, 825105, 108580, '<td valign="top">Heida challenge? I fail to see any treasure represented in this photo. Sorry!</td>', 'Heida challenge? I fail to see any treasure represented in this photo. Sorry!', '2009-10-08 03:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679960, 825788, 108580, '<td valign="top">The architect and/or interior designer who was/were involved here should have been hung at dawn. It is kitch, busy, colours clash etc.<br/>Having said that, it makes for a great subject. I think it could have done with a bit more saturation, especially the gold tones on the rails, and I''m still battling to find the exit treasure (camera). I can see you with camera top left however.</td>', 'The architect and/or interior designer who was/were involved here should have been hung at dawn. It is kitch, busy, colours clash etc.Having said that, it makes for a great subject. I think it could have done with a bit more saturation, especially the gold tones on the rails, and I''m still battling to find the exit treasure (camera). I can see you with camera top left however.', '2009-10-08 03:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679961, 825555, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge but the lighting needs some attention...</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge but the lighting needs some attention...', '2009-10-08 03:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679963, 825907, 108580, '<td valign="top">Often a treasure can be found in places like this, but I''m otherwise not getting it in your photo. That aside, the natural light from the window on the peeling blue wall is actually quite well exposed, and the other inside colours appear natural with little or no PS magic.</td>', 'Often a treasure can be found in places like this, but I''m otherwise not getting it in your photo. That aside, the natural light from the window on the peeling blue wall is actually quite well exposed, and the other inside colours appear natural with little or no PS magic.', '2009-10-08 04:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679966, 826086, 108580, '<td valign="top">Sure, the sea is filled with treasure, but the pollution (mug and other bits of crud in the sand) doesn''t do it for me in the theme and title. 5.</td>', 'Sure, the sea is filled with treasure, but the pollution (mug and other bits of crud in the sand) doesn''t do it for me in the theme and title. 5.', '2009-10-08 04:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679967, 825760, 108580, '<td valign="top">Last second entry, rushed spelling? The converging frame of the window draws me to your subject, but the light fitting and door handle top right draws me away, i''m not sure what the treasure is?</td>', 'Last second entry, rushed spelling? The converging frame of the window draws me to your subject, but the light fitting and door handle top right draws me away, i''m not sure what the treasure is?', '2009-10-08 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679970, 825810, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. The Sun is our treasure and we take it for granted.<br/>On the image side, I see more cloud dominating the sunset however.</td>', 'DMC. The Sun is our treasure and we take it for granted.On the image side, I see more cloud dominating the sunset however.', '2009-10-08 04:06:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5679980, 825414, 108580, '<td valign="top">I see the love in their expressions. The exposure however is just way off. Theres no detail in her dress and I would have emphasised (not cropped) the holding hands to carry the feeling more.</td>', 'I see the love in their expressions. The exposure however is just way off. Theres no detail in her dress and I would have emphasised (not cropped) the holding hands to carry the feeling more.', '2009-10-08 04:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679983, 825745, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Ocean is a treasure. Aquarium glass is very difficult to shoot through. Everythings dark and you don''t want to use a flash for the reflections etc. <br/>Nice try, just the glass ends top right or is hidden by a frame/pillar and focus is a bit off on the yellow submarine in front ;)</td>', 'DMC. Ocean is a treasure. Aquarium glass is very difficult to shoot through. Everythings dark and you don''t want to use a flash for the reflections etc. Nice try, just the glass ends top right or is hidden by a frame/pillar and focus is a bit off on the yellow submarine in front ;)', '2009-10-08 04:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679986, 825068, 108580, '<td valign="top">Real brumbies were worth a lot in the old days. so DMC.</td>', 'Real brumbies were worth a lot in the old days. so DMC.', '2009-10-08 04:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679989, 826032, 108580, '<td valign="top">Eeeuw. Not my kind of treasure to find!<br/>Sorry I just find the composure odd and mildly irritating and the focus on the subject is off. My opinion, sorry if I sound harsh!</td>', 'Eeeuw. Not my kind of treasure to find!Sorry I just find the composure odd and mildly irritating and the focus on the subject is off. My opinion, sorry if I sound harsh!', '2009-10-08 04:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679990, 825311, 108580, '<td valign="top">What''s she looking for? A hidden treasure? Car keys? I''m not sure I see treasure in this shot. Would have scored it better if subject was looking elsewhere and not into the lens.</td>', 'What''s she looking for? A hidden treasure? Car keys? I''m not sure I see treasure in this shot. Would have scored it better if subject was looking elsewhere and not into the lens.', '2009-10-08 04:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679992, 825437, 108580, '<td valign="top">You''ve lost me, I''ve no idea...</td>', 'You''ve lost me, I''ve no idea...', '2009-10-08 04:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679993, 825091, 108580, '<td valign="top">OK, revisited this shot. Good idea. Pity about the CMOS dust near chocolate and grubby cupboard. Expression however is classic and DMC.</td>', 'OK, revisited this shot. Good idea. Pity about the CMOS dust near chocolate and grubby cupboard. Expression however is classic and DMC.', '2009-10-08 04:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680001, 826005, 108580, '<td valign="top">I get the title, so DMC, but I find that theres no central subject in the shot to focus on. There are cutoff surfer legs on board above surfer on right standing holding board. The umbrella and OOF leaves upfront also distract. Sorry! 5.</td>', 'I get the title, so DMC, but I find that theres no central subject in the shot to focus on. There are cutoff surfer legs on board above surfer on right standing holding board. The umbrella and OOF leaves upfront also distract. Sorry! 5.', '2009-10-08 04:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680004, 826228, 108580, '<td valign="top">I get the title, and all those words are to be treasured and they are hidden in the scrabble letters, but the photo is just not striking enough for me.</td>', 'I get the title, and all those words are to be treasured and they are hidden in the scrabble letters, but the photo is just not striking enough for me.', '2009-10-08 04:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680005, 825918, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC, however the levels just make it look unnatural (to me).</td>', 'DMC, however the levels just make it look unnatural (to me).', '2009-10-08 04:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680006, 826126, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great fit for DMC, but skeleton a bit blown and OOF foreground jewels.</td>', 'Great fit for DMC, but skeleton a bit blown and OOF foreground jewels.', '2009-10-08 04:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680010, 826205, 108580, '<td valign="top">Saltwater fishes are coloured like treasure. DMC. Lighting good, focus almost perfect on fish. I dont like the composition, cropping however. I would have given him space to travel (in the photo) if you understand what I mean.</td>', 'Saltwater fishes are coloured like treasure. DMC. Lighting good, focus almost perfect on fish. I dont like the composition, cropping however. I would have given him space to travel (in the photo) if you understand what I mean.', '2009-10-08 04:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680013, 826217, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. However the coin, if semi buried for so long, would be far more corroded than it is... The blue result from incandescant WB in sunny light doesn''t work here. I would prefer to see more earth and soil tones than blue. 5.</td>', 'DMC. However the coin, if semi buried for so long, would be far more corroded than it is... The blue result from incandescant WB in sunny light doesn''t work here. I would prefer to see more earth and soil tones than blue. 5.', '2009-10-08 04:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680015, 825972, 108580, '<td valign="top">Unless the church has a hidden meaning for the photographer, I see little hidden anything here. Sorry! Proves that titles sell voters :) I didnt mark it low but didnt mark it high either.</td>', 'Unless the church has a hidden meaning for the photographer, I see little hidden anything here. Sorry! Proves that titles sell voters :) I didnt mark it low but didnt mark it high either.', '2009-10-08 04:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680016, 825942, 108580, '<td valign="top">Its a nice composition and a buggy like that is a rare find indeed. DMC.</td>', 'Its a nice composition and a buggy like that is a rare find indeed. DMC.', '2009-10-08 04:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680017, 825799, 108580, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see any treasure here at all. Unless those are very coroded sheets of Platinum :) Sorry!</td>', 'Not sure I see any treasure here at all. Unless those are very coroded sheets of Platinum :) Sorry!', '2009-10-08 04:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680018, 826035, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nope, sorry I don''t see anything hidden or valuable in this photo unless to you personally it means something. Perhaps the seeding grass is one of a kind in the field? The small stem popping up in the bottom right could have also been cropped out.</td>', 'Nope, sorry I don''t see anything hidden or valuable in this photo unless to you personally it means something. Perhaps the seeding grass is one of a kind in the field? The small stem popping up in the bottom right could have also been cropped out.', '2009-10-08 04:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680020, 825800, 108580, '<td valign="top">Yes he''s your treasure...</td>', 'Yes he''s your treasure...', '2009-10-08 04:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680021, 825337, 108580, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t find the reference to treasure or anything hidden here.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t find the reference to treasure or anything hidden here.', '2009-10-08 04:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680022, 824777, 108580, '<td valign="top">You found a treasure allright but I''ve never seen a flower like that on a beach? I might be out of the park here but I think this treasure was "planted". Maybe its not even a beach. /me waits for egg on face.<br/>I found the skewed horizon and OOF flower too much for me enjoy the shot.</td>', 'You found a treasure allright but I''ve never seen a flower like that on a beach? I might be out of the park here but I think this treasure was "planted". Maybe its not even a beach. /me waits for egg on face.I found the skewed horizon and OOF flower too much for me enjoy the shot.', '2009-10-08 04:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680024, 826117, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but pearl OOF, too much bokeh top 1/2 distracting me.</td>', 'Great idea, but pearl OOF, too much bokeh top 1/2 distracting me.', '2009-10-08 04:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680027, 825267, 108580, '<td valign="top">Blackberries are tasty and a treasure if found, but I''m not eating that one!<br/>Pity about the lack of DOF on the eyes and wings.</td>', 'Blackberries are tasty and a treasure if found, but I''m not eating that one!Pity about the lack of DOF on the eyes and wings.', '2009-10-08 04:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680029, 825466, 108580, '<td valign="top">I think the title helps the voter here. However, to the spider, any caught bug is a treasure. The photo is however seriously OOF to score high for me.</td>', 'I think the title helps the voter here. However, to the spider, any caught bug is a treasure. The photo is however seriously OOF to score high for me.', '2009-10-08 04:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680034, 825296, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and comp, colours, I just can''t focus on anything.</td>', 'Nice crop and comp, colours, I just can''t focus on anything.', '2009-10-08 04:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680036, 826202, 108580, '<td valign="top">I see what you have tried here but the DOF OOF makes me score it low, sorry!</td>', 'I see what you have tried here but the DOF OOF makes me score it low, sorry!', '2009-10-08 04:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680047, 826061, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Hard to balance the sunlight on stem vs underexposing the vanes under the dome. Good attempt though.......</td>', 'DMC. Hard to balance the sunlight on stem vs underexposing the vanes under the dome. Good attempt though.......', '2009-10-08 05:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680050, 825980, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed photo and good colours. Top half bokeh throws me. I just don''t see the treasure aspect without the actual ring. Sorry!</td>', 'Nicely exposed photo and good colours. Top half bokeh throws me. I just don''t see the treasure aspect without the actual ring. Sorry!', '2009-10-08 05:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680198, 825310, 108580, '<td valign="top">Quite striking and marvellous tones, golds, silvers, sky. I would have scored higher if you could have gotten rid of the apartments, offices middle left rear by shooting from the ground up, leaving my eye to only explore the pillars and rear tower........I am however bumping this to an 8</td>', 'Quite striking and marvellous tones, golds, silvers, sky. I would have scored higher if you could have gotten rid of the apartments, offices middle left rear by shooting from the ground up, leaving my eye to only explore the pillars and rear tower........I am however bumping this to an 8', '2009-10-08 08:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680200, 825092, 108580, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done and planned. I''m sure you will get a few complaints about the overall darkness and lighting here, but I think it''s relevant. Bumped to a 9, as long as its not a dual exposure and you didn''t pollute the environment...</td>', 'Really nicely done and planned. I''m sure you will get a few complaints about the overall darkness and lighting here, but I think it''s relevant. Bumped to a 9, as long as its not a dual exposure and you didn''t pollute the environment...', '2009-10-08 08:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680203, 826171, 108580, '<td valign="top">Blue eyes are always mesmerising. Moms, housewives, grans are all treasures, often neglected and forgotten. DMC.<br/>The shot is just OOF, and I would have used natural light in her eyes to emphasise that beautiful blue.</td>', 'Blue eyes are always mesmerising. Moms, housewives, grans are all treasures, often neglected and forgotten. DMC.The shot is just OOF, and I would have used natural light in her eyes to emphasise that beautiful blue.', '2009-10-08 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680205, 825914, 108580, '<td valign="top">Not being from your part of the world, the brand is not instantly recognisable to me. I''m guessing it''s face cream that claims to reduce all wrinkles and blemishes 2 hours before the prom? Sorry I just don''t find the picture has universal appeal or meets challenge in any meaningful way.</td>', 'Not being from your part of the world, the brand is not instantly recognisable to me. I''m guessing it''s face cream that claims to reduce all wrinkles and blemishes 2 hours before the prom? Sorry I just don''t find the picture has universal appeal or meets challenge in any meaningful way.', '2009-10-08 08:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680272, 825105, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like it when people see a treasure in ordinary things.  NICE</td>', 'I like it when people see a treasure in ordinary things.  NICE', '2009-10-08 09:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680273, 825091, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL  Too bad you couldn''t clone out the little holes to the left.  His expression cracks me up. :~O)</td>', 'LOL  Too bad you couldn''t clone out the little holes to the left.  His expression cracks me up. :~O)', '2009-10-08 09:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
