(5680509, 826156, 18403, '<td valign="top">Looks like Mesa Verde but I''ve never seen it from this angle. Truly a hidden treasure!  Your perspective and excellent detail make this a memorable image.</td>', 'Looks like Mesa Verde but I''ve never seen it from this angle. Truly a hidden treasure!  Your perspective and excellent detail make this a memorable image.', '2009-10-08 13:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680512, 826203, 18403, '<td valign="top">Superb!</td>', 'Superb!', '2009-10-08 13:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680514, 825918, 18403, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color! Well balanced composition and great dof!</td>', 'Gorgeous color! Well balanced composition and great dof!', '2009-10-08 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680518, 825760, 18403, '<td valign="top">I wud the gifties gie us....<br/>Enigmatic photo and appropo title.  A closer crop of the image to exclude the upper right might be an improvement.</td>', 'I wud the gifties gie us....Enigmatic photo and appropo title.  A closer crop of the image to exclude the upper right might be an improvement.', '2009-10-08 13:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680524, 825310, 18403, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition but the odd muted colors and halo artifacts are distracting.</td>', 'Interesting composition but the odd muted colors and halo artifacts are distracting.', '2009-10-08 13:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680534, 826136, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Good idea, but I find the shadows from only one light source annoying and better DOF throughout the entire range would have made it more striking and harder to find the penny.</td>', 'DMC. Good idea, but I find the shadows from only one light source annoying and better DOF throughout the entire range would have made it more striking and harder to find the penny.', '2009-10-08 14:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680540, 826148, 108580, '<td valign="top">The road sweeping past and <u>away</u>, the overgrown derelict structure, impending doom in the clouds, all lends itself to a movielike quality, now we need a hero to come find the treasure. I''ve revisted this photo and bumped up another point.</td>', 'The road sweeping past and away, the overgrown derelict structure, impending doom in the clouds, all lends itself to a movielike quality, now we need a hero to come find the treasure. I''ve revisted this photo and bumped up another point.', '2009-10-08 14:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680543, 826187, 108580, '<td valign="top">Poor kid... If one of those roll on him erm her, will the photog assist or take an award winning photo instead? I might have cropped a bit tighter to get rid of annoying background right top. Otherwise well spotted, colour co-ordinated kid, and "sit-still" sweet bribery with the little sucker ;)</td>', 'Poor kid... If one of those roll on him erm her, will the photog assist or take an award winning photo instead? I might have cropped a bit tighter to get rid of annoying background right top. Otherwise well spotted, colour co-ordinated kid, and "sit-still" sweet bribery with the little sucker ;)', '2009-10-08 14:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680545, 825653, 18403, '<td valign="top">Image looks slightly muddy as if taken thru a diffusing filter. Nice composition otherwise.  Try using an ''unsharp mask'' filter with a very large radius (maximum) and strength of about 20%.  This does not sharpen the image but will dispell that muddy appearance.</td>', 'Image looks slightly muddy as if taken thru a diffusing filter. Nice composition otherwise.  Try using an ''unsharp mask'' filter with a very large radius (maximum) and strength of about 20%.  This does not sharpen the image but will dispell that muddy appearance.', '2009-10-08 14:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680552, 826223, 108580, '<td valign="top">ROFL how gross is that! Nicely spotted...but still OOF.</td>', 'ROFL how gross is that! Nicely spotted...but still OOF.', '2009-10-08 14:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680653, 825466, 58231, '<td valign="top">Nice tight shot.</td>', 'Nice tight shot.', '2009-10-08 16:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680671, 826005, 92545, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5.  Not because it was bad, but to me it doesn''t strongly fit in the challenge and it''s a bit cluttered for me.  I think framing it with the tree and the hedge make it fit a bit better in the challenge, but it clutters it a bit.  Also, I''m not sure what the subject is supposed to be.  My eye is drawn to the umbrella, but I don''t think that was the intention.  I think maybe a little bit "cleaner" shot with out as much clutter would have appealed to me more.</td>', 'I gave this a 5.  Not because it was bad, but to me it doesn''t strongly fit in the challenge and it''s a bit cluttered for me.  I think framing it with the tree and the hedge make it fit a bit better in the challenge, but it clutters it a bit.  Also, I''m not sure what the subject is supposed to be.  My eye is drawn to the umbrella, but I don''t think that was the intention.  I think maybe a little bit "cleaner" shot with out as much clutter would have appealed to me more.', '2009-10-08 16:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680682, 825518, 92545, '<td valign="top">I always love silhouettes. (I had to spell that 4 times and hope that the red "spell check" line didn''t appear underneath.  Finally got it right (-:  )  I like the composition, but the reflection on the ocean takes the gracefulness away for me.  The cool tones are wonderful until they are broken up by the glare.  It also leaves a bit of a fringe around the couple.  Having said that, I''m not good at silhouettes and I''m not sure exactly how to make that better.  Possibly an angle from a bit more left would have helped, although I realize that without the reflection you would lose some drama.  (How''s that for conflicting myself several times?)  Anyway, I like the photo, but am not sure about it''s fit in this challenge.</td>', 'I always love silhouettes. (I had to spell that 4 times and hope that the red "spell check" line didn''t appear underneath.  Finally got it right (-:  )  I like the composition, but the reflection on the ocean takes the gracefulness away for me.  The cool tones are wonderful until they are broken up by the glare.  It also leaves a bit of a fringe around the couple.  Having said that, I''m not good at silhouettes and I''m not sure exactly how to make that better.  Possibly an angle from a bit more left would have helped, although I realize that without the reflection you would lose some drama.  (How''s that for conflicting myself several times?)  Anyway, I like the photo, but am not sure about it''s fit in this challenge.', '2009-10-08 16:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680683, 824775, 92545, '<td valign="top">I love the colors on the dome.  Everything else is a bit bland for me and the rotunda beneath the blue dome is pretty washed out.  I''m not sure if that could be solved with anything other than hdr, but that''s what stands out to me.  Perhaps a longer exposure with a deeper depth of field would have eliminated the blandness of the foreground.  5</td>', 'I love the colors on the dome.  Everything else is a bit bland for me and the rotunda beneath the blue dome is pretty washed out.  I''m not sure if that could be solved with anything other than hdr, but that''s what stands out to me.  Perhaps a longer exposure with a deeper depth of field would have eliminated the blandness of the foreground.  5', '2009-10-08 16:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680684, 826061, 92545, '<td valign="top">I love the angle.  I''m not sure how this fits in the challenge, though.  Also, the highlights came out a bit harsh.  If they were toned down a bit, I would have really loved this.  5</td>', 'I love the angle.  I''m not sure how this fits in the challenge, though.  Also, the highlights came out a bit harsh.  If they were toned down a bit, I would have really loved this.  5', '2009-10-08 16:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680687, 825810, 92545, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see this as "fitting" in the challenge.  It is beautiful, although it seems the most dramatic part of the sky is barely included.  Also, a slightly different crop might have balanced the shot better.  Completely cutting out the land OR including more of the land would have made it work better for me.</td>', 'I don''t really see this as "fitting" in the challenge.  It is beautiful, although it seems the most dramatic part of the sky is barely included.  Also, a slightly different crop might have balanced the shot better.  Completely cutting out the land OR including more of the land would have made it work better for me.', '2009-10-08 16:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680690, 825918, 92545, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what to think of this shot.  At first glance, it really grabs my attention, but when I examine it closer, it has a bit of an "overprocessed" look to me.  5</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what to think of this shot.  At first glance, it really grabs my attention, but when I examine it closer, it has a bit of an "overprocessed" look to me.  5', '2009-10-08 16:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680693, 825617, 92545, '<td valign="top">Your angle of capture does make this fit into the challenge (in my opinion), but it also obscures the most interesting part of the photo.  Overall, I think it lacks a bit of contrast and the tree distracts from the beauty of the haunted house.  5</td>', 'Your angle of capture does make this fit into the challenge (in my opinion), but it also obscures the most interesting part of the photo.  Overall, I think it lacks a bit of contrast and the tree distracts from the beauty of the haunted house.  5', '2009-10-08 16:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680697, 826111, 92545, '<td valign="top">I don''t really think this meets the challenge very well. (My opinion, of course)  I''m also not sure I like the point of focus.  I feel somewhat cheated that I don''t get to see the flowers in all their glory.  Also, I can''t tell which of the first buds are perfectly in focus.  I will say this really grabbed my interest.  It does make me scan the entire photo, but it leaves me slightly unsatisfied.  5</td>', 'I don''t really think this meets the challenge very well. (My opinion, of course)  I''m also not sure I like the point of focus.  I feel somewhat cheated that I don''t get to see the flowers in all their glory.  Also, I can''t tell which of the first buds are perfectly in focus.  I will say this really grabbed my interest.  It does make me scan the entire photo, but it leaves me slightly unsatisfied.  5', '2009-10-08 16:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680699, 825337, 107135, '<td valign="top">IQ not  sharp?</td>', 'IQ not  sharp?', '2009-10-08 16:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680700, 826202, 92545, '<td valign="top">A tough sell in this challenge.  :-)  Overall, I think the photo lacks the sharpness I would have liked.  I don''t know if the shutter speed was slightly too long or if the focus point wasn''t quite on his eye, but it just doesn''t quite have it.  5</td>', 'A tough sell in this challenge.  :-)  Overall, I think the photo lacks the sharpness I would have liked.  I don''t know if the shutter speed was slightly too long or if the focus point wasn''t quite on his eye, but it just doesn''t quite have it.  5', '2009-10-08 16:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680701, 825466, 107135, '<td valign="top">IQ not sharp?  Nice composition and angle...</td>', 'IQ not sharp?  Nice composition and angle...', '2009-10-08 16:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680702, 825896, 107135, '<td valign="top">IQ so sharp... Congrats</td>', 'IQ so sharp... Congrats', '2009-10-08 16:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680704, 826171, 92545, '<td valign="top">Another one that I''m not sure works in the challenge.  Also, it seems that her left eye is in better focus than the right.  Perhaps a slightly deeper depth of field would have left me more satisfied.  I know that you probably tried all different crops and who am I to say "you should have cropped it differently", BUT the crop doesn''t quite work for me.  With a shot like this, I might have tried to play with some brightness/contrast adjustments as well.  I think it could have made it more dramatic.  5</td>', 'Another one that I''m not sure works in the challenge.  Also, it seems that her left eye is in better focus than the right.  Perhaps a slightly deeper depth of field would have left me more satisfied.  I know that you probably tried all different crops and who am I to say "you should have cropped it differently", BUT the crop doesn''t quite work for me.  With a shot like this, I might have tried to play with some brightness/contrast adjustments as well.  I think it could have made it more dramatic.  5', '2009-10-08 16:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680705, 826203, 107135, '<td valign="top">Love this</td>', 'Love this', '2009-10-08 16:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680706, 826156, 107135, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2009-10-08 16:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680708, 825862, 92545, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not the only one to say, "I don''t think it fits in this challenge", but I''ll say it anyway.  :-)  I like the lighting, though.  It''s a very good shot and very sharp.  Sorry I have to give it a 5.  (I''m personally biased against the woody shots too.  I see too many of them)</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not the only one to say, "I don''t think it fits in this challenge", but I''ll say it anyway.  :-)  I like the lighting, though.  It''s a very good shot and very sharp.  Sorry I have to give it a 5.  (I''m personally biased against the woody shots too.  I see too many of them)', '2009-10-08 16:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680710, 826061, 107135, '<td valign="top">Did you see them?</td>', 'Did you see them?', '2009-10-08 16:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680712, 824777, 92545, '<td valign="top">This shot just doesn''t work for me.  The tilted horizon, graininess, and tight crop leave me a bit disoriented.  I think a different edit could have made this alot more exciting.  5</td>', 'This shot just doesn''t work for me.  The tilted horizon, graininess, and tight crop leave me a bit disoriented.  I think a different edit could have made this alot more exciting.  5', '2009-10-08 16:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680713, 825437, 107135, '<td valign="top">Very clever</td>', 'Very clever', '2009-10-08 16:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680717, 825914, 92545, '<td valign="top">I really have no idea what I''m looking at.  Therefore, I don''t see how it works in the challenge.  Maybe it''s my own ignorance.  The focus on the subject is good, but I think the brightness of the white washes out some of the details.  5</td>', 'I really have no idea what I''m looking at.  Therefore, I don''t see how it works in the challenge.  Maybe it''s my own ignorance.  The focus on the subject is good, but I think the brightness of the white washes out some of the details.  5', '2009-10-08 16:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680718, 825296, 107135, '<td valign="top">love this</td>', 'love this', '2009-10-08 16:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680720, 826097, 107135, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2009-10-08 16:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680721, 826202, 107135, '<td valign="top">Cat could have been sharper...</td>', 'Cat could have been sharper...', '2009-10-08 16:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680722, 826175, 92545, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this fitting well into the challenge.  I can''t put my finger on anything that I don''t like technically with this photo, but there''s something that bothers me about it.  Maybe it''s the focus.  It seems like the eyes of the moth should be the focus and I think, it''s actually on the flower, itself.  I could be wrong.  It might just be the small image size.  (always safe to blame dpchallenge)  :-)   5</td>', 'I don''t see this fitting well into the challenge.  I can''t put my finger on anything that I don''t like technically with this photo, but there''s something that bothers me about it.  Maybe it''s the focus.  It seems like the eyes of the moth should be the focus and I think, it''s actually on the flower, itself.  I could be wrong.  It might just be the small image size.  (always safe to blame dpchallenge)  :-)   5', '2009-10-08 16:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680723, 826032, 92545, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as a "hidden treasure".  (just my opinion)  Also, I think the monkey needed be be sharper.  I''m not sure if it''s the entire image, or just that the focus didn''t fall perfectly on him, but it lacks that crispness that I desire.  5</td>', 'I don''t see this as a "hidden treasure".  (just my opinion)  Also, I think the monkey needed be be sharper.  I''m not sure if it''s the entire image, or just that the focus didn''t fall perfectly on him, but it lacks that crispness that I desire.  5', '2009-10-08 16:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680724, 826163, 107135, '<td valign="top">Like this alot...</td>', 'Like this alot...', '2009-10-08 16:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680727, 826187, 107135, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2009-10-08 16:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680729, 826082, 92545, '<td valign="top">You gotta love shooting kids.  :-)   (that sounded wrong)  photographing kids  (better)   I have similar shots of my daughter dipping her hands into a pond.  My only complaint of this shot is the washed out nature of the highlights.  I think evening or morning light would have been more dramatic as well.  I must say, though, your border matches that top right-hand corner perfectly.  I never use borders, but yours worked really well.  5</td>', 'You gotta love shooting kids.  :-)   (that sounded wrong)  photographing kids  (better)   I have similar shots of my daughter dipping her hands into a pond.  My only complaint of this shot is the washed out nature of the highlights.  I think evening or morning light would have been more dramatic as well.  I must say, though, your border matches that top right-hand corner perfectly.  I never use borders, but yours worked really well.  5', '2009-10-08 16:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680730, 825942, 92545, '<td valign="top">This is a tough scene to photograph.  The lighting conditions make it brutal.  I really like the shot, except that there is no attention drawn to the carriage.  I know the challenge is "hidden treasures", but the darkened carriage doesn''t quite work for me.  I don''t know of any way to remedy this with the natural lighting conditions without blowing out the highlights, but it still leaves me unsatisfied.  Would you love to be able to give this an hdr treatment for this challenge?  5</td>', 'This is a tough scene to photograph.  The lighting conditions make it brutal.  I really like the shot, except that there is no attention drawn to the carriage.  I know the challenge is "hidden treasures", but the darkened carriage doesn''t quite work for me.  I don''t know of any way to remedy this with the natural lighting conditions without blowing out the highlights, but it still leaves me unsatisfied.  Would you love to be able to give this an hdr treatment for this challenge?  5', '2009-10-08 16:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680731, 825560, 107135, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2009-10-08 16:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680732, 825310, 92545, '<td valign="top">I feel really bad giving this the score I''m giving it.  It''s a gorgeous shot.  HDR?  My only problem is that it doesn''t fit the challenge.  Also, the processing left a bit of a halo around the dome.  5</td>', 'I feel really bad giving this the score I''m giving it.  It''s a gorgeous shot.  HDR?  My only problem is that it doesn''t fit the challenge.  Also, the processing left a bit of a halo around the dome.  5', '2009-10-08 16:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680733, 825800, 92545, '<td valign="top">I could see this as a "hidden treasure"  I think the crop might be just a little too tight, cutting out the right edge of the basket.  Also, dog doesn''t seem to quite be in focus.  4</td>', 'I could see this as a "hidden treasure"  I think the crop might be just a little too tight, cutting out the right edge of the basket.  Also, dog doesn''t seem to quite be in focus.  4', '2009-10-08 16:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680737, 825543, 92545, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this works in the challenge, and overall it kind of hurts my eyes.  I''m not sure if it''s the processing, or just the cluttered nature of the shot.  4</td>', 'I don''t think this works in the challenge, and overall it kind of hurts my eyes.  I''m not sure if it''s the processing, or just the cluttered nature of the shot.  4', '2009-10-08 16:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680740, 825872, 92545, '<td valign="top">That has got to be a tough shot to get.  I don''t think it works in this challenge, but I applaud the effort.  I think maybe a wider view would work better, though.  4</td>', 'That has got to be a tough shot to get.  I don''t think it works in this challenge, but I applaud the effort.  I think maybe a wider view would work better, though.  4', '2009-10-08 16:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680741, 826200, 92545, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I don''t really know what I''m looking at.  I don''t know how this was taken or what the processing was, but it doesn''t work for me.  I really need to see something that''s in focus to know what I''m looking at.  4</td>', 'Hmm, I don''t really know what I''m looking at.  I don''t know how this was taken or what the processing was, but it doesn''t work for me.  I really need to see something that''s in focus to know what I''m looking at.  4', '2009-10-08 16:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680798, 825298, 108580, '<td valign="top">Bugs are. This ones quite cute in a way, except extremely OOF (except for his eyes) and the flowers are also mostly OOF. I know how hard it is to shoot moving macro subjects, and the shallow DOF in most Macros makes it even harder, with a slower SS to try and get some DOF, and thus frustrating. I''ve shot oodles of mini critters and not one photo has been technically good allround. 6.</td>', 'Bugs are. This ones quite cute in a way, except extremely OOF (except for his eyes) and the flowers are also mostly OOF. I know how hard it is to shoot moving macro subjects, and the shallow DOF in most Macros makes it even harder, with a slower SS to try and get some DOF, and thus frustrating. I''ve shot oodles of mini critters and not one photo has been technically good allround. 6.', '2009-10-08 17:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680799, 826082, 108580, '<td valign="top">Kids think everything they find is a treasure! Hope he got you a frog :)</td>', 'Kids think everything they find is a treasure! Hope he got you a frog :)', '2009-10-08 17:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680800, 826203, 108580, '<td valign="top">Hehe, perfect expression. Well orchestrated and prepped!</td>', 'Hehe, perfect expression. Well orchestrated and prepped!', '2009-10-08 17:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680801, 825560, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Little yellow OOF box bottom middle looks like pollution/rubbish, or is it treasure within the treasure of the falls? Shot looks a wee bit off horizontal to me. Otherwise a difficult photo to take under low light conditions, handheld.</td>', 'DMC. Little yellow OOF box bottom middle looks like pollution/rubbish, or is it treasure within the treasure of the falls? Shot looks a wee bit off horizontal to me. Otherwise a difficult photo to take under low light conditions, handheld.', '2009-10-08 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680802, 826133, 108580, '<td valign="top">Is the treasure that you found the expression on the child''s face? I''m thinking out of the box here... Still a great photo.</td>', 'Is the treasure that you found the expression on the child''s face? I''m thinking out of the box here... Still a great photo.', '2009-10-08 17:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680803, 825896, 108580, '<td valign="top">Yep the Church certainly has centuries of hidden (plundered) treasures in its lofty vaults. Nice architectural shot.</td>', 'Yep the Church certainly has centuries of hidden (plundered) treasures in its lofty vaults. Nice architectural shot.', '2009-10-08 17:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680804, 825653, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. It will open to reveal it''s treasure. Nice colours.</td>', 'DMC. It will open to reveal it''s treasure. Nice colours.', '2009-10-08 17:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680805, 826072, 108580, '<td valign="top">Pandora''s Box? DMC. Nicely done.</td>', 'Pandora''s Box? DMC. Nicely done.', '2009-10-08 17:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680806, 825518, 108580, '<td valign="top">I liked your shot, only thing that threw me was I''d prefer to have seen just the couple without the surfers...</td>', 'I liked your shot, only thing that threw me was I''d prefer to have seen just the couple without the surfers...', '2009-10-08 17:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680807, 824775, 108580, '<td valign="top">It''s probably full of looted treasure. A nice find, but wobbled so only a 5.</td>', 'It''s probably full of looted treasure. A nice find, but wobbled so only a 5.', '2009-10-08 17:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680808, 826154, 108580, '<td valign="top">Good exposure to capture the rays and highlights in the cloud. The Sun is a treasure, we don''t value it enough in our lives and thus take it for granted. We often forget that a picture tells a thousand words and place too much emphasis on technical ability. I personally would have zoomed in on the clouds and avoided the trees completely.</td>', 'Good exposure to capture the rays and highlights in the cloud. The Sun is a treasure, we don''t value it enough in our lives and thus take it for granted. We often forget that a picture tells a thousand words and place too much emphasis on technical ability. I personally would have zoomed in on the clouds and avoided the trees completely.', '2009-10-08 17:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680809, 825846, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Just the telephone pole bottom left could have been cropped out.</td>', 'DMC. Just the telephone pole bottom left could have been cropped out.', '2009-10-08 17:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5681029, 825267, 109962, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. Very interesting, good colors and illustrates the theme well.</td>', 'I really like this picture. Very interesting, good colors and illustrates the theme well.', '2009-10-08 21:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
