(5684820, 826148, 5746, '<td valign="top">Oh my... I LOVE this picture. Everything - composition (placing the subject in the strongest point of the picture), colors, light (!!!) and detail. Magnificent sky... Excellent idea which very well conveys the challenge theme. I wish advanced editing rules applied here - you could clone out the stakes (at least remove this red spot on one of them). I hope it will do well in this challenge. Bumping up to 10.</td>', 'Oh my... I LOVE this picture. Everything - composition (placing the subject in the strongest point of the picture), colors, light (!!!) and detail. Magnificent sky... Excellent idea which very well conveys the challenge theme. I wish advanced editing rules applied here - you could clone out the stakes (at least remove this red spot on one of them). I hope it will do well in this challenge. Bumping up to 10.', '2009-10-12 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684821, 826086, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very subtle colours scheme. I like the details and deep DOF. Interesting pattern made by the water on the sand. Looks like the pot was really thrown out by the sea. Bumping up to 9.</td>', 'Very subtle colours scheme. I like the details and deep DOF. Interesting pattern made by the water on the sand. Looks like the pot was really thrown out by the sea. Bumping up to 9.', '2009-10-12 18:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
