(5684829, 826035, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like grass and rye. They are so beautiful, fragile and often overlooked. Nice detail, good composition and I like shallow DOF. This picture hits the string in me. Good luck :) Bumping up to 7</td>', 'I like grass and rye. They are so beautiful, fragile and often overlooked. Nice detail, good composition and I like shallow DOF. This picture hits the string in me. Good luck :) Bumping up to 7', '2009-10-12 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684830, 826217, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like the fact, that one really has to look for your treasure :) I like the blue hue. It makes it really cold, like a Siberian things should be. Background is a bit confusing, but it adds to the theme. Good luck :) 7.</td>', 'I like the fact, that one really has to look for your treasure :) I like the blue hue. It makes it really cold, like a Siberian things should be. Background is a bit confusing, but it adds to the theme. Good luck :) 7.', '2009-10-12 18:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684831, 826156, 5746, '<td valign="top">This picture came to me as one of the last ones. There is too much of sky for my liking, especially, that there is nothing interesting in the sky - no clouds, no colors - just plain area of blue. I would prefer to see more of the dwelling, as it is an excellent subject for this challenge. Fresh idea and very DMC. I like the detail and deep DOF. Good luck :) 7.</td>', 'This picture came to me as one of the last ones. There is too much of sky for my liking, especially, that there is nothing interesting in the sky - no clouds, no colors - just plain area of blue. I would prefer to see more of the dwelling, as it is an excellent subject for this challenge. Fresh idea and very DMC. I like the detail and deep DOF. Good luck :) 7.', '2009-10-12 18:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684832, 825972, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice HDR effect. The church is not very hidden, but I like the idea. Bumping up.</td>', 'Nice HDR effect. The church is not very hidden, but I like the idea. Bumping up.', '2009-10-12 18:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
