(5684836, 826061, 5746, '<td valign="top">Saturation is almost unrealistic - so rich. I like the effect however, as it looks like an illustration from a fairy tale - which again goes very well with the title. The sky color is making the most fake impression. Adjusting scores. Good luck!</td>', 'Saturation is almost unrealistic - so rich. I like the effect however, as it looks like an illustration from a fairy tale - which again goes very well with the title. The sky color is making the most fake impression. Adjusting scores. Good luck!', '2009-10-12 18:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684841, 825879, 5746, '<td valign="top">Background is a bit distracting. I guess it''s there for a reason, but I don''t get it :( The blue light reflection on the nut is also misleading. Overall - nice color scheme, nice subject, very DMC - good luck :) Bumping up</td>', 'Background is a bit distracting. I guess it''s there for a reason, but I don''t get it :( The blue light reflection on the nut is also misleading. Overall - nice color scheme, nice subject, very DMC - good luck :) Bumping up', '2009-10-12 18:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684842, 825869, 5746, '<td valign="top">The wood looks pink on my monitor. At first I thought it''s a piece of flesh... Very nice DOF. I like the pattern made by stones. I like the color scheme (despite odd effect on the wood - probably my monitor). I don''t think it is such a treasure indeed, but I guess such stack of stones would drive my attention as well. Nice composition. Good luck :) Bumping up.</td>', 'The wood looks pink on my monitor. At first I thought it''s a piece of flesh... Very nice DOF. I like the pattern made by stones. I like the color scheme (despite odd effect on the wood - probably my monitor). I don''t think it is such a treasure indeed, but I guess such stack of stones would drive my attention as well. Nice composition. Good luck :) Bumping up.', '2009-10-12 18:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
