(5686814, 826187, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is a really good picture but you would have been a top 3 if you would have zoomed in a bit and removed everything that had nothing to do with the pumpkins.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your new Personal Best (PB). Again welcome to DPC<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-14 09:58:06.</i></td>', 'This is a really good picture but you would have been a top 3 if you would have zoomed in a bit and removed everything that had nothing to do with the pumpkins. Congrats on your new Personal Best (PB). Again welcome to DPC', '2009-10-14 10:57:14.000000', '2009-10-14 10:58:06.000000', 0),
(5686828, 826203, 92577, '<td valign="top">expected this to win</td>', 'expected this to win', '2009-10-14 11:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5686836, 825799, 108564, '<td valign="top">I think it is a very interesting shot.  Nice texture, colors - simple and clean.</td>', 'I think it is a very interesting shot.  Nice texture, colors - simple and clean.', '2009-10-14 11:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
