(5687010, 826072, 81530, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon!', '2009-10-14 12:27:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687011, 825092, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the challenge. Congrats!</td>', 'Good interpretation of the challenge. Congrats!', '2009-10-14 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687015, 826203, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Congrats.</td>', 'Great shot. Congrats.', '2009-10-14 12:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687018, 826203, 92545, '<td valign="top">I knew you were going to beat me from your scores posted in the forum...  Glad to see it was a great shot like this one.  It also appears you had one more hater than I did.  I had three "1''s" and 0 "2''s"  It''s about time whoever is posting these "1''s" explained themselves.  You definitely didn''t deserve them.  Glad you did well.</td>', 'I knew you were going to beat me from your scores posted in the forum...  Glad to see it was a great shot like this one.  It also appears you had one more hater than I did.  I had three "1''s" and 0 "2''s"  It''s about time whoever is posting these "1''s" explained themselves.  You definitely didn''t deserve them.  Glad you did well.', '2009-10-14 12:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687021, 826228, 92545, '<td valign="top">So this is the HawkeyeLonewolf entry.  This really was one of my favorites.  I saw your posts in the forum and wondered which entry was yours.  Definitely should have scored higher.  I see you had the haters too with the two 1''s and two 2''s.  Such a shame.</td>', 'So this is the HawkeyeLonewolf entry.  This really was one of my favorites.  I saw your posts in the forum and wondered which entry was yours.  Definitely should have scored higher.  I see you had the haters too with the two 1''s and two 2''s.  Such a shame.', '2009-10-14 12:31:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687033, 826203, 61073, '<td valign="top">Congrats Baby, I am so proud of you for adding another ribbon to your collection. You did great.</td>', 'Congrats Baby, I am so proud of you for adding another ribbon to your collection. You did great.', '2009-10-14 12:42:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687037, 825296, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful Jo!  Lovely softness where needed and yet sharply focused.  Nice piece</td>', 'Really beautiful Jo!  Lovely softness where needed and yet sharply focused.  Nice piece', '2009-10-14 12:44:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687050, 826203, 68947, '<td valign="top">Actually quite ingenious!  It really looked like a peanut butter jar and what we all do to get the last bits out of it.  <br/> <br/>Love the concept and the execution of it!  Congrats!!!</td>', 'Actually quite ingenious!  It really looked like a peanut butter jar and what we all do to get the last bits out of it.   Love the concept and the execution of it!  Congrats!!!', '2009-10-14 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687092, 825092, 39427, '<td valign="top">sooooo perfect for the challenge</td>', 'sooooo perfect for the challenge', '2009-10-14 13:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687097, 825760, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit too much forethought and effort for the brown, but the spelling might have put you a bit closer!  (I''d not have recognized the quote, but would have figured the title to be intentional.)  And do you really think people see you as a knife-wielding lizard standing on its hind legs?</td>', 'A bit too much forethought and effort for the brown, but the spelling might have put you a bit closer!  (I''d not have recognized the quote, but would have figured the title to be intentional.)  And do you really think people see you as a knife-wielding lizard standing on its hind legs?', '2009-10-14 13:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687098, 826126, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love your vision!  Very cool take on the challenge.  Can''t get much more literal!  :-)</td>', 'LOL!  Love your vision!  Very cool take on the challenge.  Can''t get much more literal!  :-)', '2009-10-14 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687101, 826133, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t think he''s using a cell phone either.  I think you nailed it with your title, though in real life, he''s probably wondering if he''s in the right place or doing the right thing according to the re-enactment.  A great catch, and your processing suits it very well.</td>', 'I don''t think he''s using a cell phone either.  I think you nailed it with your title, though in real life, he''s probably wondering if he''s in the right place or doing the right thing according to the re-enactment.  A great catch, and your processing suits it very well.', '2009-10-14 13:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687132, 825942, 30861, '<td valign="top">Disappointing finish for a wonderful, atmospheric shot.</td>', 'Disappointing finish for a wonderful, atmospheric shot.', '2009-10-14 13:34:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687134, 825617, 30982, '<td valign="top">Still, quite a nifty "treasure" when you look at it.  Not many folks can find a place like this to photograph!</td>', 'Still, quite a nifty "treasure" when you look at it.  Not many folks can find a place like this to photograph!', '2009-10-14 13:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687146, 825760, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hah, this HAD to be yours! I wondered how many would "get" the Burns, and I see at least one other did. Kudos on another enigmatic tour-de-force.</td>', 'Hah, this HAD to be yours! I wondered how many would "get" the Burns, and I see at least one other did. Kudos on another enigmatic tour-de-force.', '2009-10-14 13:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687173, 826203, 43410, '<td valign="top">this is amazing...perfect job!</td>', 'this is amazing...perfect job!', '2009-10-14 14:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687256, 826072, 46918, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 1st ribbon....Hopefully I will join you at some time in the future...Great shot by the way</td>', 'Congrats on your 1st ribbon....Hopefully I will join you at some time in the future...Great shot by the way', '2009-10-14 16:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687415, 825947, 108580, '<td valign="top">My comment unhelpful? Strange. Obviously it''s your find and a treasure to you thus i said:<br/>DMC = DOES meet challenge. <br/>(DNMC = Does NOT meet challenge.)<br/>I liked the shot and actually gave it a 7<br/>Oh well :(</td>', 'My comment unhelpful? Strange. Obviously it''s your find and a treasure to you thus i said:DMC = DOES meet challenge. (DNMC = Does NOT meet challenge.)I liked the shot and actually gave it a 7Oh well :(', '2009-10-14 17:55:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687473, 826203, 28742, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, Joe! Congratulations! <br/>...sup with the 4 peanut butter haters?</td>', 'Brilliant, Joe! Congratulations! ...sup with the 4 peanut butter haters?', '2009-10-14 18:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687493, 826187, 92545, '<td valign="top">I experimented with tighter crops on this one (since cropping was the only real criticism I drew other than the title) and almost entered one.  For this particular challenge, though, I wanted to make the treasure "hidden" and it was much more obvious with tighter crops.  Also, it removed most of the cornucopia which made it lose a little something to me.</td>', 'I experimented with tighter crops on this one (since cropping was the only real criticism I drew other than the title) and almost entered one.  For this particular challenge, though, I wanted to make the treasure "hidden" and it was much more obvious with tighter crops.  Also, it removed most of the cornucopia which made it lose a little something to me.', '2009-10-14 18:50:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687539, 826072, 82749, '<td valign="top">Very well done, fit the topic nicely.  Congrats on the red!!!</td>', 'Very well done, fit the topic nicely.  Congrats on the red!!!', '2009-10-14 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687765, 826203, 86958, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2009-10-14 20:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687819, 825105, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love it - great use of the lensbaby. Excellent dof.</td>', 'Love it - great use of the lensbaby. Excellent dof.', '2009-10-14 21:48:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687835, 826072, 51747, '<td valign="top">Great shot! ;)</td>', 'Great shot! ;)', '2009-10-14 22:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687853, 825799, 59029, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 6 on this, more for the technical execution than anything else.  Nothing wrong with the shot, but challenges centred on abstract ideas are much tougher to execute.  Good work though and keep it up!</td>', 'I gave you a 6 on this, more for the technical execution than anything else.  Nothing wrong with the shot, but challenges centred on abstract ideas are much tougher to execute.  Good work though and keep it up!', '2009-10-14 22:32:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687883, 826203, 51793, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Brilliant, Joe! Congratulations! <br/>...sup with the 4 peanut butter haters? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No clue! I don''t think this should have got a 1 at all...</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Brilliant, Joe! Congratulations! ...sup with the 4 peanut butter haters?   No clue! I don''t think this should have got a 1 at all...', '2009-10-14 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687885, 825947, 109962, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Magnum_za:</b></div><hr/><i> My comment unhelpful? Strange. Obviously it''s your find and a treasure to you thus i said:<br/>DMC = DOES meet challenge. <br/>(DNMC = Does NOT meet challenge.)<br/>I liked the shot and actually gave it a 7<br/>Oh well :( </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Don''t take offense...didn''t understand what DMC meant (thanks for telling me) because I just joined the group and I don''t understand all the abbreviations yet :)<br/>I appreciate the good score and the comment about the blown highlights. I''m also a fairly new photographer, so I want advice on how to make my photos better. How could I have fixed the highlight problem?</td>', 'Originally posted by Magnum_za: My comment unhelpful? Strange. Obviously it''s your find and a treasure to you thus i said:DMC = DOES meet challenge. (DNMC = Does NOT meet challenge.)I liked the shot and actually gave it a 7Oh well :(   Don''t take offense...didn''t understand what DMC meant (thanks for telling me) because I just joined the group and I don''t understand all the abbreviations yet :)I appreciate the good score and the comment about the blown highlights. I''m also a fairly new photographer, so I want advice on how to make my photos better. How could I have fixed the highlight problem?', '2009-10-14 23:11:08.000000', NULL, 0),
