(5689720, 825092, 38162, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AllAccess:</b></div><hr/><i> Love anything Nikon, but if you need a critique, the shot is well composed and stunning but too surreal.  It looks like, but not implying, that you worked it photoshop.  It has the "photo contest look."  You know?  I like it, it''s obviously great but too surreal for my taste. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>let me get this straight.  you love anything nikon?  what the heck does that have to do with anything?!  so you give extra pts to nikons?  wow.  and you forgive him for possibly using PS?  and you dont like anything surreal?  and it has a photo contest look?  THIS IS A PHOTO CONTEST.  sorry if I am missing the point that you have absolutely nothing to say here.</td>', 'Originally posted by AllAccess: Love anything Nikon, but if you need a critique, the shot is well composed and stunning but too surreal.  It looks like, but not implying, that you worked it photoshop.  It has the "photo contest look."  You know?  I like it, it''s obviously great but too surreal for my taste.   let me get this straight.  you love anything nikon?  what the heck does that have to do with anything?!  so you give extra pts to nikons?  wow.  and you forgive him for possibly using PS?  and you dont like anything surreal?  and it has a photo contest look?  THIS IS A PHOTO CONTEST.  sorry if I am missing the point that you have absolutely nothing to say here.', '2009-10-16 15:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5690205, 826203, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a glorious tribute to one of my favorite types of sandwiches.  Congrats on ribboning with a creative, funny, unique entry!  I also think it''s cool you pulled off the rare trick of getting a higher score from participants than non-participants.  Maybe photographers can better appreciate the humor and difficulty of coming up with a different idea.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-17 01:40:05.</i></td>', 'Oh, what a glorious tribute to one of my favorite types of sandwiches.  Congrats on ribboning with a creative, funny, unique entry!  I also think it''s cool you pulled off the rare trick of getting a higher score from participants than non-participants.  Maybe photographers can better appreciate the humor and difficulty of coming up with a different idea.', '2009-10-17 02:35:48.000000', '2009-10-17 02:40:05.000000', 0),
